.PP
Run \f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[I]COMMAND\f[R] \f[B]\(enhelp\f[R] for full
options of any command, or open the dedicated man page (e.g.\ \f[B]man
inspekt\-axe\f[R], \f[B]man inspekt\-storage\f[R]).
.SH CONFIGURATION
Inspekt reads configuration from \f[I]\(ti/.config/inspekt.json\f[R]
(created on first run with \f[B]inspekt config\f[R]).
Frequently used settings include:
.TP
\f[B]ai\-language\f[R]
Preferred natural\-language for AI commands such as \f[B]inspekt
summarize\f[R] and \f[B]inspekt describe\f[R] (\(lqauto\(rq detects from
the page).
.TP
\f[B]bridge\-port\f[R]
TCP port the bridge server listens on (default 8888).
The same port is used by the browser extension to connect.
.PP
Run \f[B]inspekt config\f[R] to open the file in your default editor;
\f[B]inspekt info config\f[R] prints the active configuration with
sources.
.SH FILES
.TP
\f[I]\(ti/.config/inspekt.json\f[R]
User configuration file.
.TP
\f[I]\(ti/.inspekt/data.db\f[R]
SQLite database holding plugin definitions, command customizations,
cached AI responses, and recording metadata.
.TP
\f[I]\(ti/.local/share/inspekt/\f[R]
Recordings, screenshots, and saved page exports written by Inspekt.
.TP
\f[I]\(ti/.local/share/man/man1/inspekt\-*.1\f[R]
Personalized man pages installed by \f[B]inspekt man install
\(enuser\f[R].
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\f[B]INSPEKT_VERBOSE\f[R]
When set to \f[I]1\f[R], equivalent to passing \f[B]\(enverbose\f[R] to
every command.
.TP
\f[B]INSPEKT_NO_TIPS\f[R]
When set to \f[I]1\f[R], suppresses tips and hints in command output.
.TP
\f[B]INSPEKT_INSTANCE\f[R]
Default browser instance ID, alias, or index to target.
.TP
\f[B]INSPEKT_RESTRICTED\f[R]
When set to \f[I]1\f[R], hides commands that are dangerous in a shared
or sandboxed terminal (set by the Inspekt VM terminal server).
.TP
\f[B]ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\f[R], \f[B]OPENAI_API_KEY\f[R]
Used by AI commands such as \f[B]inspekt ask\f[R] and \f[B]inspekt
describe\f[R].
.SH EXAMPLES
Open a URL in the connected browser:
.IP
.EX
inspekt open https://example.com
.EE
.PP
Run an axe\-core accessibility audit on the current page:
.IP
.EX
inspekt axe
.EE
.PP
Take a full\-page screenshot:
.IP
.EX
inspekt screenshot \-\-full
.EE
.PP
Record a sequence of interactions and replay it later:
.IP
.EX
inspekt record demo.yaml
inspekt replay demo.yaml
.EE
.PP
Ask a natural\-language question about the current page:
.IP
.EX
inspekt ask \(dqwhat is this page about?\(dq
.EE
